<title>SRI LANKA: Weather - Showers forecast for parts of Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather - Showers forecast for parts of Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department on Wednesday forecast showers with thunder at times in the Central, Sabaragamuwa, Western and Southern provinces and in the Kurunegala district for Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that thunder-showers would develop in the Uva, Eastern and Northcentral provinces during Thursday afternoon or evening.</p>
<p>The department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Wednesday morning:</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Canyon		   58.4</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	    34.0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		  43.0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		 55.5</p>
<p>    Moussakele	     23.2</p>
<p>    Norton		   60.5</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   2.2</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
</text>
